## Third-party notices

Third-party components used in this project remain under their own licenses:

- **FilamentMixer pigment model** (`src/core/filamentMixer.mjs`, `vendor/filamentMixer.ts`)
  — MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 **Justin Hayes**.
  TypeScript port of the header-only C++ pigment colour mixer, coefficients
  auto-generated from the reference implementation:
  <https://github.com/ratdoux/OrcaSlicer-FullSpectrum> (`src/libslic3r/filament_mixer_model.h`).
  Used to predict Full Spectrum mixed colours (blue + yellow → green) instead of
  a naive RGB average.

- **Snapmaker U1 conversion** (`src/core/u1Convert.mjs`, `src/core/orcaProfiles.mjs`)
  is written from scratch for this project. It reads machine geometry from a
  locally installed Snapmaker Orca's system profiles at runtime; no third-party
  converter code or profile data is vendored into this repository.

- Everything else (3MF/STL/OBJ/AMF/GLB/STEP parsing, colour analysis, spool
  suggestion, export writers, UI) is original work of this project.
